    "description": "Port City Colombo joins Western Province\u2019s \u2018Lights of Hope\u2019 amid national recovery",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/port-city-colombo-joins-western-provinces-lights-of-hope-amid-national-recovery/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
