    "description": "Somasundaram Nadesan QC  will be remembered for his brilliance as a lawyer, as an indefatigable fighter for human rights and for taking up public causes. He was an extraordinary human being.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86797",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
    "time_ut": 1766173260.0,
