    "chunk_size_bytes": 1121,
    "chunk_text": "VFS Global launches Malta Visa Centre in Sri Lanka\n\nVFS Global and the Malta High Commission in New Delhi have opened a Malta Visa Application Centre in Colombo. Inaugurated on 3 December 2025, the centre will begin processing applications on 1 February 2026.\n\nIt offers Sri Lankan citizens a convenient local point to submit Schengen visa applications for travel to Malta, with final assessment remaining with the Malta High Commission in New Delhi.\n\nHigh Commissioner Reuben Gauci noted the growing number of Sri Lankans travelling to Malta and stated the centre improves access for applicants.\n\nVFS Global\u2019s COO for South Asia, Yummi Talwar, highlighted the company\u2019s trusted partnership with Malta since 2008 and the enhanced, modern facilities the new centre provides.\n\nSL Real Estate Excellence Shines at 2025 PropertyGuru Asia Property Awards\n\nRootcode creating the future of digital governance with Sri Lankan talent\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
