    "md5": "b1252895bbb8f66329939bc18d5b8fc8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1345,
    "chunk_text": "ANC and Achievers Lanka enhance academic pathways\n\nANC Education and Achievers Lanka Business School have partnered to create a seamless academic pathway for professional qualification holders. Students completing CIMA at Achievers Lanka can now progress to a Top-up Degree or an MBA through ANC Education in partnership with the University of West London, UK. This collaboration integrates professional credentials with internationally recognized academic awards to enhance graduates\u2019 global employability.\n\nLeadership from both institutions highlighted the partnership\u2019s strategic value. According to Azad Hye, Chairman of Achievers Lanka, it combines Achievers\u2019 excellence with ANC\u2019s academic standing to shape globally competitive professionals. CEO Lahiru Karunarathna noted the collaboration provides students a clear pathway for global success. ANC Education CEO Dayan Fernando stated the partnership accelerates the transition from professional credentials to globally recognized degrees, reflecting a shared vision for developing future-ready graduates.\n\nHNB Assurance marks major milestones in its technological transformation journey\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
