    "chunk_text": "HNB Assurance marks major milestones in its technological transformation journey\n\nHNB Assurance PLC has successfully completed all major phases in its multi-year transformation program, an integral component of the Technological Transformation Pillar under the company\u2019s SET Framework \u2013 (Sales Force Expansion, Exceptional Customer Service and Technological Transformation), introduced in 2022 when the company introduced its strategy to achieve 10% market share by 2026.\n\nAs part of the technology pillar, HNBA undertook a complete redesign and redevelopment of its core insurance management system to enhance agility, operational resilience, and digital capability across all customer touchpoints. The new core system NSure Insurance Suite, powered by KGiSL- a BFSI-centric Multiproduct Enterprise Software Product Company, went live in mid-2024, followed by the successful completion of full data migration in 2025. With these phases completed, HNB Assurance is now gearing up for the next stage, Java migration, which will further optimize performance and scalability. Additionally, KGiSL has trained and certified HNBA\u2019s teams on maximizing NSure\u2019s capabilities, empowering them to achieve minimal TAT and consistent operational excellence.\n\nSpeaking on the organization\u2019s transformation journey, Lasitha Wimalaratne, Executive Director / Chief Executive Officer of HNB Assurance PLC \u201cThis transformation is not just a system upgrade, it is a reinvention of how we serve our customers, partners, and employees. Over the past few years, our teams have worked tirelessly to rebuild our technological backbone while keeping customer needs at the center. Completing both systems go-live and data migration marks a defining moment for HNB Assurance as we prepare for a future that demands speed, intelligence and digital readiness.\u201d\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment 