    "description": "Unsung Heroes of the Central Bank 3:  Dr. D. S. Wijesinghe, quantitative economist who did not have previous training in math",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Unsung-Heroes-of-the-Central-Bank-3-Dr-D-S-Wijesinghe-quantitative-economist-who-did-not-have-previous-training-in-math/4-785925",
    "lang": "en",
