    "chunk_size_bytes": 1250,
    "chunk_text": "Inner Vision at the Gatz\n\nThe group Inner Vision is gradually making its presence felt in the local showbiz scene.\n\nThey made their debut, early this year, performing at The Little Hut, in Mount Lavinia, and now find themselves ready to do the needful at the famous Gatz.\n\nThe band will be featured on Boxing Day, 26th December, from 8.30 pm onwards.\n\nLocated at Cinnamon Life, City of Dreams, Gaz has now become the \u2018in place\u2019 for high class entertainment, and Inner Vision is looking forward to creating an exciting scene for those who make it to Gaz this Friday.\n\nAnd, on New Year\u2019s Eve, Inner Vision will usher in 2026 at the Cheers Pub, in Colombo.\n\nThe band also has regular dates at The Irish Pub, in Colombo.\n\nIn fact, they will be doing the Christmas Eve scene, that\u2019s tomorrow night, at the Irish Pub.\n\nBassist Benjy Ranabahu is extremely happy with the progress Inner Vision is making and is confident 2026 will be an exciting year for the band.\n\nNo evidence that babies were used as bait in colonial Sri Lanka, says leading herpetologist\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
