    "chunk_text": "Sunshine Holdings marks World Diabetes Day\n\nSunshine Holdings marked World Diabetes Day with its \u201cUnmask Diabetes 2025\u201d initiative. Across 10 Healthguard outlets in Colombo, the Sunshine Foundation for Good provided free blood sugar and blood pressure screenings to nearly 900 people over two days.\n\nParticipants received professional consultations on prevention, management, and lifestyle adjustments. Group CEO Shyam Sathasivam emphasized the importance of early detection and accessible preventive healthcare to address Sri Lanka\u2019s growing diabetes challenge.\n\nThis community-based program is part of the Foundation\u2019s ongoing healthcare pillar, Suwa Diviya, focused on raising awareness and supporting national wellbeing.\n\nGroundworth secures special recognition for land investments at Asia Property Guru Awards 2025\n\nColombo Bourse erases early gains as Dockyard plunges and IMF loan concerns dampen sentiment\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
