    "md5": "6e6e048262608ae92e89b1db77d5a5a7",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 400,
    "chunk_text": "Asriel Marketing donates Rs. 5 m to \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund\n\nAsriel Marketing Ltd. has contributed Rs. 5 million to the Government\u2019s \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund, established to assist communities affected by the Ditwah cyclone. The contribution was formally handed at the Presidential Secretariat by Asriel Marketing Chairman Shiran Peiris together with other executives of the company."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
