    "chunk_text": "The Avenue Colombo unveils new dining experiences for holiday season\n\nThe Avenue Colombo recently welcomed the festive season by introducing a refreshed culinary and hospitality experience, centered on comfort, connection, and versatile dining. More than a formal launch, the event felt like a warm gathering of long-time patrons and new friends, all sharing in the brand\u2019s signature hospitality.\n\nGuests previewed new menu additions and the return of modernized classics, alongside the debut of the\u00a0Front Porch Caf\u00e9 @ The Avenue. This relaxed space is designed for casual coffee, meals, and conversation, answering a growing desire in Colombo for welcoming, familiar environments.\n\nThe evening also highlighted the popular mist-cooled backyard garden \u2013 an eco-friendly, BYOB-friendly oasis perfect for relaxed gatherings. The Avenue now offers fully customized menus for private events across these versatile spaces.\n\nCulinary highlights featured\u00a0Australian Prime Steaks, ranging from 250g to a impressive 2000g, complemented by a curated wine list and a high-end cocktail bar. \u201cThis is a new chapter with the same heart \u2013 good food, honest flavors, and a place where people can truly relax,\u201d shared the culinary team, emphasizing a commitment to guest-driven experiences.\n\nAs The Avenue looks ahead, its focus remains on genuine hospitality, great food, and comfortable spaces for every occasion.\n\nSince opening in 2019, The Avenue Colombo has established itself as a premier dining destination, offering premium Australian prime steaks, American-inspired cuisine, curated wines, and signature cocktails. Its versatile spaces cater to everyday dining, private celebrations, and business events.\n\nPrime Group stands with children of police families affected by Cyclone Ditwah\n\nOgilvy Group continues winning streak at Campaign Asia Agency of the Year Awards\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be publis