    "description": "Govt. urges Constitutional Council to act on Auditor General appointment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Govt-urges-Constitutional-Council-to-act-on-Auditor-General-appointment/56-786049",
    "lang": "en",
