    "chunk_text": "Lion Brewery recognised as Sri Lanka\u2019s Top Beverage Exporter\n\nLion Brewery (Ceylon) PLC has been awarded \u2018Best Exporter \u2013 Beverages\u2019 at the 27th Presidential Export Awards. The national accolade recognises its exceptional export performance and role in promoting Sri Lankan brands globally.\n\nCEO Rajiv Meewakkala stated the award endorses the company\u2019s commitment to \u201ctaking Sri Lankan excellence to the world.\u201d The brewery\u2019s exports grew by 64% year-on-year, with its products now available in over 19 countries across five continents. Key growth markets include Africa, the UAE, Australia, and Italy.\n\nThe company\u2019s international strategy combines local market adaptation with consistent quality. Its flagship beers, Lion Stout and Lion Lager, have also recently received global taste awards, reinforcing the brand\u2019s worldwide reputation.\n\nInglish Razor steps up to help combat digital violence against women\n\nFlemingo Duty Free partners with global initiative to support Cancer Hospital\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
