    "chunk_text": "Flemingo Duty Free partners with global initiative to support Cancer Hospital\n\nFlemingo Duty Free has pledged support to the National Cancer Hospital (Apeksha Hospital) in Maharagama through a partnership with The Moodie Davitt Report\u2019s global KickCancerThon initiative. The commitment was announced at the ICA International Marathon in Colombo on December 14, 2025.\n\nThe donation was formally handed over by Deputy High Commissioner of India, Dr. Satyanjal Pandey, to Dr. Randima Nanayakkara, Consultant Oncosurgeon. The funds are designated for the hospital\u2019s Surgical Department to aid patient care.\n\n\u201cThis initiative represents a meaningful step in supporting local communities and advancing cancer awareness,\u201d stated P.K. Thimmayya, Director of Flemingo Duty Free.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
