    "chunk_text": "IMC Campus celebrates graduates at BMICH ceremony\n\nIMC Campus held its Annual Graduation Ceremony at the BMICH on December 8, 2025, recognising over 200 graduating students. The event was graced by Chief Guest Professor Udaya Mohan Devdas from the University of Kelaniya, alongside founder Dr. Kavya Jayakody.\n\nStudents received Bachelor\u2019s, Master\u2019s, and Doctoral qualifications. IMC Campus, a partner of IIC University of Technology (Cambodia) and London Management Qualifications (UK), offers programs in management, education, and AI, maintaining a high success rate for working professionals.\n\nFlemingo Duty Free partners with global initiative to support Cancer Hospital\n\nSri Lanka rolls out digital signature framework to accelerate digital economy\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
