    "chunk_size_bytes": 1219,
    "chunk_text": "16th Jaffna International Trade Fair returns in January 2026\n\nThe Jaffna International Trade Fair (JITF), Northern Sri Lanka\u2019s largest and most influential multitrade exhibition, will return for its 16th consecutive year from 23 to 25 January 2026 at the Muttraweli Ground in Jaffna. As the region\u2019s most established commercial platform, the fair continues to play a central role in advancing economic betterment, fostering business connectivity, and promoting technology-driven innovation across the Northern Province. Organised by Lanka Exhibition & Conference Services (LECS)\u2014Sri Lanka\u2019s leading exhibition and trade-show organiser and Presidential Award Winner in association with the Chamber of Commerce & Industries of Yarlpanam (CCIY)\u2014JITF has grown into one of the country\u2019s most anticipated annual events. LECS, known for its professionalism and decades-long industry expertise, ensures that JITF offers top-tier participation, wide national visibility, and a steady promotional reach throughout the Jaffna Peninsula. Its strong network and reputation continue to draw businesses, investors, and institutions that recognise the fair as a strategic gateway to the rapidly developing Northern market."
