    "description": "Morison \u2018Suwa Deya\u2019 platform supports cyclone\u2011affected communities with purpose\u2011driven action",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Morison-Suwa-Deya-platform-supports-cycloneaffected-communities-with-purposedriven-action/34-786125",
