    "description": "Several private companies donate to \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Several-private-companies-donate-to-Rebuilding-Sri-Lanka/34-786126",
    "lang": "en",
