    "date_str": "2025-12-25",
    "description": "Lion Brewery reaffirms commitment to flood resilience and community support in Biyagama",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Lion-Brewery-reaffirms-commitment-to-flood-resilience-and-community-support-in-Biyagama/34-786128",
    "lang": "en",
