    "chunk_text": "Bally\u2019s celebrates 30 years in entertainment sector, honours over 300 employees\n\nBally\u2019s celebrated three decades as a Sri Lankan entertainment leader at its Grand Awards 2025. Held at ITC Ratnadipa Colombo recently, the ceremony honoured over 300 employees for dedication, loyalty, and exceptional performance across various categories.\n\nChairman Anuradha Perera attended as Chief Guest. The event, blending traditional and modern themes, reflected Bally\u2019s evolution. Speeches by the CEO and CHRO highlighted the people-centric culture and collective journey.\n\nNew ADB report unveils major energy-saving potential for Sri Lanka\u2019s key sectors\n\n60-foot Christmas tree marks progress at Colombo International Airport Hotel site\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
