    "md5": "4be17f7baa178f21895884fed44f4acb",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1810,
    "chunk_text": "FACETS 2026 to unveil new era for Sri Lanka\u2019s gem and jewellery trade\n\nThe gem and jewellery sector is poised for a transformative start to 2026 as FACETS Sri Lanka, the country\u2019s premier international exhibition, prepares to open its doors on January 3rd at a bold new location. Marking its 33rd edition, the event will debut at The Forum, Cinnamon Life at City of Dreams, signalling a major upgrade in scale and ambition for the industry\u2019s flagship showcase.\n\nRelocating to the integrated resort\u2019s state-of-the-art convention facility, FACETS 2026 will span two floors, offering the most expansive platform in its history for buyers, traders, and connoisseurs. The modern infrastructure of Cinnamon Life is expected to provide an elevated and immersive experience, injecting fresh energy into the presentation of Sri Lanka\u2019s celebrated gemstone heritage.\n\nIn a landmark development for the local trade, the globally revered\u00a0G\u00fcbelin Gem Lab\u00a0will participate for the first time as the Official Gem Lab Partner. This partnership, a first at any Sri Lankan gem exhibition, grants exhibitors and international visitors direct access to world-class on-site gem testing and certification from an institution with over a century of expertise.\n\nThe exhibition is bolstered by a robust consortium of premier corporate partners.\u00a0Cinnamon Life\u00a0serves as the Hotel and Venue Partner, with support from\u00a0John Keells Properties\u00a0as Real Estate Partner,\u00a0Brinks\u00a0as Official Security Partner, and\u00a0LMD\u00a0as Official Business Magazine. The strengthened backing underscores the event\u2019s significant economic footprint.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
