    "description": "Beyond relief: Building Sri Lanka\u2019s digital disaster brain",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Beyond-relief-Building-Sri-Lanka-s-digital-disaster-brain/4-786159",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
