    "description": "$ 35 m Humanitarian Priorities Plan for Ditwah victims",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/35-m-Humanitarian-Priorities-Plan-for-Ditwah-victims/56-786196",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
