    "md5": "98510d1965789140abbf4567e523cb3f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1699,
    "chunk_text": "MAC celebrates 29 years of success and corporate excellence\n\nMAC Holdings Ltd., celebrated its 29th anniversary recently, marking nearly three decades of purposeful growth, integrity-led leadership, and a deep commitment to every stakeholder who has been part of its journey.\n\nThe company said it has continuously evolved with changing times while remaining firmly anchored to the corporate philosophy that defines its identity, \u201cWe cannot spell success without you.\u201d This enduring belief reflects the company\u2019s conviction that its achievements are inseparable from the contributions of its customers, partners, service providers, employees, and the communities it serves.\n\n\u201cIt is this collective strength that has driven MAC to uphold exceptional customer service, strong governance, and unwavering social responsibility throughout its history. Today, MAC stands as a diversified industry leader with operations across freight and logistics, aviation, shipping, hospitality and leisure, renewable energy, fisheries and agriculture, and strategic investments,\u201d the company said in a statement.\n\nIts regional presence extends to Bangladesh, Maldives, UAE, Singapore and agency partnerships in India and Pakistan, strengthening its footprint across key markets in Asia and the Middle East. Guided by its mission to be a multifaceted group of companies recognised for its diversified commercial interests and value-driven offerings, MAC continues to champion innovation, dynamism, and sustainable growth. The company\u2019s values, respect, accountability, trust, integrity, and a strong ESG consciousness remain the pillars that define its corporate culture and inform every strategic decision."
