    "chunk_text": "Its regional presence extends to Bangladesh, Maldives, UAE, Singapore and agency partnerships in India and Pakistan, strengthening its footprint across key markets in Asia and the Middle East. Guided by its mission to be a multifaceted group of companies recognised for its diversified commercial interests and value-driven offerings, MAC continues to champion innovation, dynamism, and sustainable growth. The company\u2019s values, respect, accountability, trust, integrity, and a strong ESG consciousness remain the pillars that define its corporate culture and inform every strategic decision.\n\n\u201cThe 29th anniversary celebration was a moment of gratitude and reflection, marked by religious blessings conducted by leaders representing all major faiths, symbolising unity, harmony, and the inclusive spirit that defines the MAC family,\u201d the Company said.\n\nManaging Director Andre Fernando emphasised the core values that will propel MAC into its next phase of growth. He reminded the team to remain honest, uphold integrity, be selfless in their service, and treat the company as their own, as values that he believes are essential for collective success. He reiterated that MAC thrives because of teamwork and the willingness of people to put the organisation first.\n\nAs the company steps confidently into its 30th year, MAC said it remains committed to empowering its people, strengthening global partnerships, embracing innovation, and contributing responsibly to society and the environment. With nearly three decades of progress and a heritage that spans over a century, MAC Holdings Ltd., moves forward with pride, clarity, and the steadfast belief that success is meaningful only when shared, because at MAC, \u201cWe cannot spell success without you.\u201d"
