    "chunk_size_bytes": 1875,
    "chunk_text": "Velona marks 85 years  of Sri Lankan legacy, innovation, and care\n\nVelona, one of\u00a0Sri Lanka\u2019s most cherished homegrown brands, is celebrating 85 years of trust, care, and innovation, marking a journey that began in 1940 and continues to touch the lives of generations of Sri Lankan families. Built on a foundation of quality, comfort, and compassion, Velona\u2019s story is one of resilience, evolution, and an unwavering commitment to the wellbeing of those it serves.\n\nThe Velona legacy was founded by the late Ruskin Fernando, a visionary pioneer in Sri Lanka\u2019s textile and apparel industry. At a time when local manufacturing was still in its infancy, he built what became one of Asia\u2019s largest textile enterprises, creating thousands of livelihoods in Moratuwa and beyond. His leadership, grounded in humility, discipline, integrity, and social responsibility, demonstrated how industry could uplift communities while maintaining uncompromising standards of quality.\n\nThat founding ethos continues to guide Velona today now strengthened and re-energised under the leadership of Velona Group Chairman Dr. Gehan De Soysa. Since assuming leadership, Dr. De Soysa has led a transformational phase of exponential growth, bringing fresh vision, global thinking, and renewed vibrancy to a long-loved local brand. While remaining deeply rooted in Sri Lankan values, Velona has been strategically re-positioned as a future-ready family care brand, capable of competing on international platforms.\n\n\u201cReaching 85 years is not just a milestone\u2014it is a responsibility,\u201d said Dr. De Soysa. \u201cA responsibility to every parent, every child, and every stakeholder who has trusted Velona across generations. My commitment is to honour my grandfather\u2019s legacy by raising our standards of care, safety, and innovation, while giving Velona the wings to fly beyond our shores.\u201d"
