    "description": "Rebuild smarter, better: A call to reimagine the railway to Kandy after Cyclone Ditwah",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Rebuild-smarter-better-A-call-to-reimagine-the-railway-to-Kandy-after-Cyclone-Ditwah/14-786243",
