    "description": "EDB\u2019s National Packaging Centre empowers exporters with EU food labelling legislation workshop",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/EDB-s-National-Packaging-Centre-empowers-exporters-with-EU-food-labelling-legislation-workshop/34-786251",
    "lang": "en",
