    "description": "A nearly nine-month vacancy and the quiet crisis of accountability",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/A-nearly-nine-month-vacancy-and-the-quiet-crisis-of-accountability/4-786286",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
