    "chunk_size_bytes": 312,
    "chunk_text": "Handled well, the aftermath of Cyclone Ditwah can become another chapter where crisis gives way to reform, recovery, and renewed economic confidence supported by a partnership that has repeatedly proven its reliability.\n\n(The author is a chartered accountant and could be reached via email at [email\u00a0protected])"
