    "chunk_size_bytes": 417,
    "chunk_text": "Down one track lies the comfortable path: rebuild what we had, amber light blinking, delays baked in, deficits widening, future storms waiting to repeat the trauma.\n\nDown the other lies a harder path: governance reform, climate-proofing, disciplined PPPs, smarter funding, and technological modernisation.\n\nThis time, we should not merely get Sri Lanka Railways back on track. We should lay a better track altogether."
