    "description": "Singer expands luxury footprint with grand unveiling of \u2018Signature by Singer\u2019 at One Galle Face",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Singer-expands-luxury-footprint-with-grand-unveiling-of-Signature-by-Singer-at-One-Galle-Face/34-786296",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
