    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "3c87396070bb2a7ae87241f237f79ec1",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1472,
    "chunk_text": "Singer expands luxury footprint with grand unveiling of \u2018Signature by Singer\u2019 at One Galle Face\n\nSinger Sri Lanka PLC has announced the launch of Signature by Singer, a premium home and living experience at the Singer Flagship Store, One Galle Face Mall. The new showroom marks a significant expansion of Singer\u2019s mission to deliver global-standard, design-driven home solutions to Sri Lankan consumers.\n\nDeveloped in partnership with the Signature Group, Malaysia\u2019s largest kitchen cabinet and wardrobe manufacturer with nearly three decades of industry leadership, the showroom brings together contemporary design, luxury craftsmanship and complete lifestyle concepts under one roof. The space has been curated to offer an immersive environment where customers can experience the look and feel of refined living, enhanced by Singer\u2019s trusted service excellence and longstanding reputation for quality.\n\nSinger Sri Lanka PLC Group Managing Director Mahesh Wijewardene said, \u201cAt Singer, our vision is to enhance the quality of home living for every Sri Lankan. Our partnership with Signature marks another important step in that journey. The new showroom at One Galle Face is designed to inspire; offering complete living concepts that reflect luxury, elegance and modern functionality. We are proud to bring international-standard craftsmanship to Sri Lanka, backed by Singer\u2019s trusted service, nationwide reach and long-term commitment to our customers.\u201d"
  },
