    "md5": "293db365feea1a15e033fbf05b6645ff",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1168,
    "chunk_text": "Singer Sri Lanka PLC Group Managing Director Mahesh Wijewardene said, \u201cAt Singer, our vision is to enhance the quality of home living for every Sri Lankan. Our partnership with Signature marks another important step in that journey. The new showroom at One Galle Face is designed to inspire; offering complete living concepts that reflect luxury, elegance and modern functionality. We are proud to bring international-standard craftsmanship to Sri Lanka, backed by Singer\u2019s trusted service, nationwide reach and long-term commitment to our customers.\u201d\n\nThe opening ceremony brought together the senior management from Singer and the Signature Group, alongside interior designers, industry professionals and distinguished guests. Their presence underscored the growing demand for curated, international-standard home concepts within the country.\n\nWith the unveiling of this exclusive showroom, Singer strengthens its position as a total home-solutions provider, making premium global design more accessible to discerning Sri Lankan customers. The Signature by Singer showroom at the Singer Flagship Store, One Galle Face Mall, is now open daily during mall hours."
