    "md5": "e59db52a226349c373a03db00b081275",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1513,
    "chunk_text": "Siyapatha Finance expands islandwide footprint to Nikaweratiya\n\nHomegrown finance company Siyapatha Finance PLC recently opened its 61st branch in Nikaweratiya, successfully progressing a step further with the Company\u2019s broader expansion efforts of bringing holistic financial solutions to all communities across Sri Lanka.\n\nThe newest branch was declared open by Siyapatha Finance PLC Managing Director Ananda Seneviratne, in the presence of Chief Executive Officer (Designate) Mathisha Hewawitharana, and senior management, as well as Police OIC Harison Somasiri, Grama Niladhari H.M.T. Namal Bandara representatives of the government and private banks and insurance companies, and well-wishers.\n\nEndowed with fertile soil and flat lands ideal for cultivation, Nikeweratiya has gained fame for its agricultural heritage and prominence, where the community continues to place emphasis on the integration of unique farming techniques to this day.\n\nWhile traditionally and historically renowned for agriculture, Nikaweratiya has diversified its economic base into non-traditional industries. Presently, the employment landscape is dominated by the service sector, agriculture and industrial sectors.\n\nOver the span of a few decades, Nikaweratiya saw a remarkable shift in the real estate industry. The region\u2019s positioning \u2013 supported by advancing infrastructure and improved climate for investments \u2013 has paved the way to a rise in modern housing projects as well as the availability of commercial spaces."
