    "chunk_text": "Over the span of a few decades, Nikaweratiya saw a remarkable shift in the real estate industry. The region\u2019s positioning \u2013 supported by advancing infrastructure and improved climate for investments \u2013 has paved the way to a rise in modern housing projects as well as the availability of commercial spaces.\n\nBoasting a comprehensive product portfolio ranging from leasing, fixed deposits, gold financing, business loans, personal loans, fast draft, and factoring to \u201cSmart Pay\u201d \u2013 its bill payment facility, the newest branch aims to help entrepreneurs, small and medium-scale enterprises (SMEs), and aspiring young individuals to seize growth opportunities and encourage smart financial decision-making in the long run.\n\nFollowing the recent floods in the country and the number of lives affected , a low key opening ceremony was conducted and the money had been allocated for donating gift vouchers for the school children to buy school shoes and socks.\n\nPort City Colombo reaches 11 years: Developer reaffirms commitment to further project progress\n\nBank of Ceylon contributes Rs. 500 million to government\u2019s \u201cRebuilding Sri Lanka\u201d fund\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
