    "description": "Sri Lanka needs more than transparency to break the cycle of corruption: University of London Economists",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Sri-Lanka-needs-more-than-transparency-to-break-the-cycle-of-corruption-University-of-London-Economists/14-786331",
