    "chunk_text": "SLIIT donates  Rs. 20 m to \u201cRebuilding Sri Lanka\u201d Fund\n\nThe Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology Guarantee Limited (SLIIT) has made a financial donation of Rs. 20 million to the Government\u2019s \u201cRebuilding Sri Lanka\u201d Fund to provide relief to those affected by Cyclone Ditwah. The relevant cheque was handed over recently at the Presidential Secretariat by SLIIT Chairman/Chancellor Prof. Lakshman Ratnayake and Vice-Chancellor and Managing Director/CEO Prof. Lalith Gamage to Secretary to the President Dr. Nandika Sanath Kumanayake."
