    "chunk_size_bytes": 1949,
    "chunk_text": "From Awards to World Stages: Colombo Coffee Company\u2019s historic year of leadership, growth, and global impact\n\nColombo Coffee Company, Sri Lanka\u2019s largest and most awarded coffee solutions provider, marked an extraordinary year of growth, recognition, and industry leadership, firmly cementing its position as the driving force behind the evolution of Sri Lanka\u2019s coffee sector.\n\nThe year began with a historic milestone as Colombo Coffee Company made history at the Best Management Practices Company Awards 2025, organized by the Chartered Professional Managers (CPM) Sri Lanka. Standing tall among 126 leading corporate organizations, the company secured the Overall Silver Award, a true testament to its excellence in governance, strategy, and operational leadership. Further accolades at the same awards included the Excellence Award in Best Management Practices, Sector Winner \u2013 Manufacturing (Food & Beverage), and a Merit Award in the ESG Cluster, underscoring the company\u2019s strong commitment to sustainability and responsible business practices.\n\nAdding to this achievement, Kushan Samararatne, General Manager of Colombo Coffee Company, was honored with the Excellence in Leadership Award, recognizing his transformative leadership and vision that continues to steer the company towards innovation and long-term impact.\n\nBuilding on this momentum, Colombo Coffee Company was named the Outstanding Coffee and Coffee-Related Products Company of the Year at the Asia Miracle Awards, further reinforcing its dominance and credibility on a regional platform.\n\nSamararatne\u2019s leadership excellence was further recognized at the Management & Leadership Excellence Awards 2025, where he emerged as Winner \u2013 Manufacturing (Food & Beverage) Category, Overall Silver \u2013 Management & Leadership Excellence, and Winner \u2013 Sustainability & Circular Economy Category, highlighting a leadership approach rooted in growth, people, and purpose."
