    "chunk_text": "Samararatne\u2019s leadership excellence was further recognized at the Management & Leadership Excellence Awards 2025, where he emerged as Winner \u2013 Manufacturing (Food & Beverage) Category, Overall Silver \u2013 Management & Leadership Excellence, and Winner \u2013 Sustainability & Circular Economy Category, highlighting a leadership approach rooted in growth, people, and purpose.\n\nMarking a defining turning point for the Sri Lankan coffee industry, Colombo Coffee Company was fully acquired by Akbar Brothers, signaling a powerful new chapter of scale, strength, and national significance for the brand and the industry at large.\n\nBeyond accolades, Colombo Coffee Company continued to play a pivotal role in promoting Sri Lankan coffee, partnering with multiple institutions and spearheading initiatives such as La Dolce Tazza, an iconic platform celebrating Italian coffee culture while creating global exposure in partnership with the Italian Embassy of Sri-Lanka and learning opportunities for the local industry.\n\nMathisha Hewavitharana appointed Chief Executive Officer as veteran Ananda Seneviratne concludes his tenure as Managing Director\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
